          "quote": "For alloy A, dot-like gray phases (or circle regions) of 3–6 mm in size disperse in the eutectic matrix and branches of dendrites are hardly observed.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "Fig. 1",
          "chunk_id": "0fa344c063c1b537:part:001"
